properties.DESCRIPTION:
Rezoning from "One-Acre Residential Zone (RA)" to "Comprehensive Development Zone (CD)"; 
Form and Character Development Permit to permit the development of 86 townhouse units, including 15 live/work units , Sensitive Ecosystem Development Permit for the purposes of wetland preservation.  
Subdivision from 2 lots to 3 lots (two townhouse lots and one remnant lot, to be developed at future date).
